    "The Big Five (OCEAN) is the most researched model in personality psychology. It scores five broad traits that everyone has to some degree." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Big Five (OCEAN) is the most researched model in personality psychology. It scores five broad traits that everyone has to some degree."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De Big Five (OCEAN) is het best onderzochte model in de persoonlijkheidspsychologie. Het meet vijf brede eigenschappen die iedereen in een bepaalde mate heeft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Enneagram describes nine types, each driven by its own core motivation and fear. The lines in the figure show how the types connect." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Enneagram describes nine types, each driven by its own core motivation and fear. The lines in the figure show how the types connect."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het Enneagram beschrijft negen types, elk gedreven door een eigen kernmotivatie en angst. De lijnen in de figuur laten zien hoe de types met elkaar samenhangen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
